1. Accuracy: How often does the AI model produce correct results?
2. Precision: How precise are the results produced by the AI model?
3. Recall: How well does the AI model identify relevant results?
4. F1 Score: A weighted average of precision and recall.
5. Training Data Quality: How well does the AI model perform on high-quality training data?
6. Generalization: How well does the AI model perform on new, unseen data?
7. Robustness: How well does the AI model perform under different conditions or inputs?
8. Speed: How quickly does the AI model produce results?
9. Scalability: How well does the AI model perform on large datasets or in high-volume scenarios?
10. Explainability: How well can the AI model explain its reasoning and decision-making process?
