                for (Cell cell : row) {
                    if (cell.getColumnIndex() == 0) {
                        decision = cell.getStringCellValue();
                    } else {
                        scores[i] = cell.getNumericCellValue();
                        i++;
                    }
                }
                double weightedScore = calculateWeightedScore(scores, weights);
                String bestOutcome = determineBestOutcome(scores);
                System.out.println("Decision: " + decision + ", Weighted Score: " + weightedScore + ", Best Outcome: " + bestOutcome);
            }
            fis.close();
        } catch (IOException e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
        }
    }

    public static double calculateWeightedScore(double[] scores, double[] weights) {
        double weightedScore = 0;
        for (int i = 0; i < scores.length; i++) {
            weightedScore += scores[i] * weights[i];
        }
        return weightedScore;
    }

    public static String determineBestOutcome(double[] scores) {
        double maxScore = scores[0];
        int maxIndex = 0;
        for (int i = 1; i < scores.length; i++) {
            if (scores[i] > maxScore) {
                maxScore = scores[i];
                maxIndex = i;
            }
        }
        switch (maxIndex) {
            case 0:
                return "Outcome 1";
            case 1:
                return "Outcome 2";
            case 2:
                return "Outcome 3";
            default:
                return "";
        }
    }
}
```
In this code, the `calculateWeightedScore()` method calculates the weighted score for a decision option based on the scores for each outcome option and their corresponding weights. The `determineBestOutcome()` method determines the best outcome option for a decision option based on the scores for each outcome option.
The main method reads the Excel file, iterates over the rows in the sheet, and for each row, calculates the weighted score and determines the best outcome option for each decision option. The results are printed to the console.

